### 1. Registro Usuario A (será el OWNER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "1234abcd"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenA", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("userIdA", response.body.userId);
%}

### Login Usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@test.com",
  "password": "1234abcd"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### Login Carla
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carla@test.com",
  "password": "1234abcd"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenC", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### Login Bruno
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bruno@test.com",
  "password": "1234abcd"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenB", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 2. Registro Usuario B (será invitado como MEMBER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bruno",
  "email": "bruno@test.com",
  "password": "1234abcd"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenB", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("userIdB", response.body.userId);
%}

### 3. Registro Usuario C (se queda FUERA del tablero)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carla",
  "email": "carla@test.com",
  "password": "1234abcd"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenC", response.body.accessToken);
%}

### 4. Ana crea un tablero -> debe convertirse automáticamente en OWNER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boards
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

{
  "name": "Tablero de Ana",
  "boardOrder": 0
}

> {%
    client.global.set("boardId", response.body.id);
%}

### 5. Ana invita a Bruno por email -> debe crear BoardMember con rol MEMBER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/boards/members/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "boardId": "2bc44ed7-5e27-4520-abca-7e89d08b8077",
  "email": "bruno@test.com"
}

### 6. Comprobar la lista de miembros (lectura abierta, cualquiera puede verla)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/boards/2bc44ed7-5e27-4520-abca-7e89d08b8077/members
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### 7. Bruno (MEMBER) crea una columna en el tablero de Ana -> debe funcionar (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/columns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

{
  "name": "Pendiente",
  "columnOrder": 0,
  "boardId": "2bc44ed7-5e27-4520-abca-7e89d08b8077"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("columnId", response.body.id);
%}

### 8. Carla (NO es miembro) intenta crear una columna -> debe dar 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/columns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

{
  "name": "Intento de intrusión",
  "columnOrder": 1,
  "boardId": "{{boardId}}"
}

### 9. Bruno (MEMBER) crea una tarea -> debe funcionar (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

{
  "title": "Tarea de Bruno",
  "description": "Probando permisos de miembro",
  "columnId": "cd73ac51-ba4b-45b3-8bf9-229ee278671e"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("taskId", response.body.id);
%}

### 9b. Asignar la tarea a Bruno
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "taskId": "b7273285-6b70-43c3-bf7f-1dd1e72e568f",
  "assignedUserId": "df9746a0-e404-4c6e-b03a-4c3c8f6c6cdd"
}

### 10. Bruno (MEMBER) intenta RENOMBRAR el tablero -> debe dar 400 (solo el OWNER puede)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/boards/rename
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

{
  "boardId": "2bc44ed7-5e27-4520-abca-7e89d08b8077",
  "newName": "Bruno intenta renombrar"
}

### 11. Bruno (MEMBER) intenta EXPULSAR a alguien -> debe dar 400 (solo el OWNER puede)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/boards/2bc44ed7-5e27-4520-abca-7e89d08b8077/members/7ea97b9f-9db6-436c-a5a9-9d1ecbe5b126
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### 12. Ana (OWNER) expulsa a Bruno -> debe funcionar (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/boards/2bc44ed7-5e27-4520-abca-7e89d08b8077/members/df9746a0-e404-4c6e-b03a-4c3c8f6c6cdd
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### 13. Bruno, ya expulsado, intenta crear otra columna -> debe dar 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/columns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

{
  "name": "Ya no debería poder",
  "columnOrder": 2,
  "boardId": "2bc44ed7-5e27-4520-abca-7e89d08b8077"
}

### 14. Ana intenta autoexpulsarse -> debe dar error controlado (400)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/boards/{{boardId}}/members/{{userIdA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}